  "description": "The Mule Jäger SD is the evolution of our flagship workhorse, built for hunters who demand more. We kept the heart of the Mule, Bafang’s Ultra mid‑drive motor, the “diesel engine” of ebike motors and the industry‑leading rack system that accepts up to 40 Ah of battery capacity for outstanding range. But for the Jäger, we added a German‑engineered Rohloff 14‑speed internal gear hub. It delivers a massive gear range and lets you shift while standing still, so you never lose momentum on steep climbs or while towing a fully loaded trailer. This isn’t just transportation; it’s a backcountry utility vehicle purpose‑built for serious hunters and adventurers.",
